Title: Model.hasMany(OtherModel)  doesn't use name of foreign key specified in OtherModel
Description: I have the following two models:
User and CropSession were User.hasMany(models.CropSession). In CropSession I reference the table Users with referenceKey: id as userId.

When I do

``` js
User.find({where: {id: 1}}).then(function(user) {
